    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat's Showdown is a casual card battle game where two mischievous cat brothers clash using simplified poker-based mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you\u2019re not familiar with poker, the rules are easy to learn\u2014making it perfect for new players and seasoned card fans alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play quick, turn-based battles in a relaxing singleplayer mode. No timers, no pressure\u2014just you, your cards, and clever cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an offline PvE experience, ideal for short sessions or casual play on the go.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat's Showdown is a casual card battle game where two mischievous cat brothers clash using simplified poker-based mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you\u2019re not familiar with poker, the rules are easy to learn\u2014making it perfect for new players and seasoned card fans alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play quick, turn-based battles in a relaxing singleplayer mode. No timers, no pressure\u2014just you, your cards, and clever cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an offline PvE experience, ideal for short sessions or casual play on the go.</p>",
